  "title": [
    "[Nereid's Cradle, Beach]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "Spilling into the beach, tumbled stones stand at the head of a game trail that disappears through dunes that are covered in feather-headed grass.  Rhythmic and persistent, the azure waves deposit a bright frothy, white surf upon the glittering sand before receding into the turquoise waters of the cove.  A long picnic table surrounded by sun-faded benches sits back from the tideline and is relatively dry."
  ],
